WEBVTT

00:00:15.010 --> 00:00:22.080
Looking up at the purple panorama of the galaxy highway...

00:00:24.050 --> 00:00:30.190
...a shooting star pierces my heart.

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:38.000
synchronized with the sleepless city...
My accelerating heartbeat is

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:44.770
...and I suddenly pray for the unseen tomorrow...

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:50.010
...that brings that melody.

00:00:51.810 --> 00:00:56.950
A mysterious voice won't let me go.

00:00:57.490 --> 00:01:03.560
Oh, tell me seventh moon, this frustrated heart...

00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:09.330
...where will you take me to?

00:01:09.770 --> 00:01:15.840
To sway in the blue seventh moon...

00:01:16.270 --> 00:01:25.750
...searching for the answer to the rhythm in this crazy dance.

00:01:31.560 --> 00:01:34.260
194th place !
What good's that ?!

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:36.520
Although we've made our debut,
we're not selling any records !

00:01:36.520 --> 00:01:40.020
Thinking about it doesn't do us any good.
It's not going to happen if you don't sing.

00:01:40.020 --> 00:01:41.210
Is that so.

00:01:41.810 --> 00:01:42.780
I understand.

00:01:43.930 --> 00:01:47.470
Ray, although it was only a short
while, it was nice knowing you.

00:01:50.750 --> 00:01:54.790
And he doesn't sing
with all his heart.

00:01:54.790 --> 00:01:56.760
Is that how things
are going for you ?

00:01:56.760 --> 00:01:57.620
Rain ?

00:01:57.620 --> 00:02:00.320
Have you forgotten
the tale in the dream ?

00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:03.790
Whether that clan is well
suited to my dream or not.

00:02:03.790 --> 00:02:06.020
That is what
I am investigating.

00:02:15.260 --> 00:02:21.170
DEEP BALLAD

00:02:25.710 --> 00:02:27.560
What the...?

00:02:33.020 --> 00:02:34.290
Why ?!

00:02:37.560 --> 00:02:39.510
What the hell do you think
you're doing with my Valkyrie ?!

00:02:39.510 --> 00:02:41.850
That's it, that's it !
Just perfect !

00:02:47.160 --> 00:02:50.470
All right ! I'll join you
in just a sec. Hold on.

00:02:50.470 --> 00:02:52.950
Ray, what's the
meaning of this ?!

00:02:52.950 --> 00:02:56.770
Like I told you...
Regular maintenance.

00:02:58.120 --> 00:03:01.370
Really...you never pay
attention to what people say.

00:03:01.370 --> 00:03:02.340
You're here, too ?

00:03:02.340 --> 00:03:03.500
Of course I am !

00:03:03.500 --> 00:03:04.350
Why ?

00:03:04.350 --> 00:03:07.800
I wanted to get Ray's
opinion on a song.

00:03:07.800 --> 00:03:09.370
This early in the morning ?

00:03:09.370 --> 00:03:12.170
Oh, geez...
it's almost noon.

00:03:12.170 --> 00:03:13.570
Oh, right...

00:03:15.160 --> 00:03:20.020
Wouldn't it be faster if I just rode it there
instead of having you carry it there like this ?

00:03:20.020 --> 00:03:24.960
If you go marching around town in a
battroid, you'll frighten other drivers.

00:03:25.610 --> 00:03:27.460
In any case,
I'll take care of it.

00:03:27.900 --> 00:03:31.230
But I'm not really keen on other
people poking around in it.

00:03:31.230 --> 00:03:33.000
I told you to just
leave everything to me.

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:35.890
They're old buddies of mine.
Trust me.

00:03:41.580 --> 00:03:42.810
Old buddies ?

00:03:43.800 --> 00:03:46.910
Hey, what did
Ray do before ?

00:03:46.910 --> 00:03:49.710
You joined this band without
even knowing something like that ?

00:03:49.710 --> 00:03:50.750
Yeah, but...

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:53.650
Anyway, what did he do ?

00:03:53.650 --> 00:03:55.220
I have no
idea either.

00:03:55.220 --> 00:03:56.420
What ?!

00:03:56.420 --> 00:03:59.550
As a matter of principle, I don't go
snooping around in other people's pasts.

00:04:01.460 --> 00:04:03.140
I'm going
back to sleep.

00:04:04.920 --> 00:04:07.220
I wonder what
Ray used to do...

00:04:15.610 --> 00:04:16.740
Hello.

00:04:17.460 --> 00:04:18.600
Akiko !

00:04:18.600 --> 00:04:19.950
Where's Ray ?
In his room ?

00:04:19.950 --> 00:04:22.740
Well, he just
stepped out.

00:04:22.740 --> 00:04:23.750
I see...

00:04:23.750 --> 00:04:25.980
Is something up ?

00:04:25.980 --> 00:04:29.230
I wanted to talk to him
about the upcoming concert.

00:04:29.230 --> 00:04:32.120
It'll be a good
chance for Fire Bomber.

00:04:33.220 --> 00:04:37.640
I was able to round up some people from
the industry. I think it'll be a good chance.

00:04:37.640 --> 00:04:39.400
It's a great chance !

00:04:39.400 --> 00:04:44.760
I wanted to go over the details, but without
Ray, maybe it'd be best if I came back later.

00:04:44.760 --> 00:04:48.320
Definitely !  Definitely !  I'll be sure
to have him call you right away !

00:04:48.320 --> 00:04:50.260
Thank you.

00:04:50.260 --> 00:04:53.810
He's always been so
hard to track down.

00:04:55.150 --> 00:04:58.650
Akiko, you've known Ray
for quite some time, right ?

00:04:58.650 --> 00:05:00.160
That's right.

00:05:00.160 --> 00:05:02.480
What did Ray
do before ?

00:05:02.480 --> 00:05:03.880
You don't know ?

00:05:03.880 --> 00:05:04.610
No.

00:05:04.610 --> 00:05:07.460
A pilot...
an elite forces pilot.

00:05:08.010 --> 00:05:09.270
A pilot ?!

00:05:31.200 --> 00:05:35.620
Some of the paint's peeled away,
but otherwise, it looks okay.

00:05:35.620 --> 00:05:39.810
Your estimates are better
than our measurements.

00:05:39.810 --> 00:05:42.980
The VF-19 really
is state-of-the-art.

00:05:42.980 --> 00:05:45.560
This Valkyrie is a masterpiece.

00:05:50.790 --> 00:05:53.850
I understand a top-of-the-line
Valkyrie is in there...

00:05:53.850 --> 00:05:57.260
I'd like to
take a look.

00:05:57.260 --> 00:06:04.320
I'm sorry sir, but only Hangar 20 personnel
and other authorized people may enter.

00:06:04.320 --> 00:06:08.550
I just wanted to see if it's
a Valkyrie I've seen before.

00:06:08.550 --> 00:06:10.620
I'm very sorry, Lieutenant.

00:06:13.790 --> 00:06:15.860
No matter how well
it does on the tests...

00:06:15.860 --> 00:06:18.910
...there's no way the VF-19 will
be delivered without compensation.

00:06:18.910 --> 00:06:19.980
Right.

00:06:19.980 --> 00:06:23.610
Under these circumstances,
Operation M is being delayed.

00:06:23.610 --> 00:06:24.610
Right...

00:06:24.610 --> 00:06:27.720
If things don't progress according to
the schedule, we'll have to reschedule...

00:06:27.720 --> 00:06:31.320
That won't be necessary !
Just give us a bit more time !

00:06:32.910 --> 00:06:34.360
Captain Maximilian...

00:06:36.360 --> 00:06:42.380
All I'm sure of is that the pilot,
Nekki Basara, is pretty good.

00:06:42.380 --> 00:06:44.140
C...Captain !

00:06:44.140 --> 00:06:48.460
But compared to how good I used to be,
he's still got a ways to go.

00:06:52.430 --> 00:06:55.470
Sorry, but only
industry members today.

00:06:57.020 --> 00:07:00.280
Hey !  For some reason, this
isn't our usual kind of audience !

00:07:00.280 --> 00:07:01.870
What did you expect ?

00:07:01.870 --> 00:07:06.260
Miss Akiko worked hard to get
TV directors and video producers...

00:07:06.260 --> 00:07:10.600
...along with music magazine editors
and anyone who matters down here.

00:07:10.600 --> 00:07:12.600
Oh, really...

00:07:12.600 --> 00:07:17.010
We may have a CD out, but it's not going
to do us any good if we don't sell any.

00:07:17.010 --> 00:07:23.190
Even if only one person out
there notices you, it'll be good.

00:07:23.190 --> 00:07:25.730
Thank Akiko, will ya ?

00:07:25.730 --> 00:07:27.930
Oh, thank you.

00:07:27.930 --> 00:07:30.020
It was no trouble.

00:07:30.020 --> 00:07:32.490
We'll just play like usual.

00:07:32.490 --> 00:07:33.140
Right.

00:07:41.600 --> 00:07:48.010
Let's get started, it's Saturday night.
How're you guys doing ?

00:07:48.010 --> 00:07:52.470
Let's stand up, do you feel the beat ?

00:07:54.260 --> 00:08:00.310
This is a flying paradise.
A forgotten energy...

00:08:00.310 --> 00:08:04.660
Now hurry up and take it back.

00:08:07.010 --> 00:08:09.410
No more wastin' time.

00:08:09.410 --> 00:08:18.560
Before everything fades away like a dream.

00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:20.960
Spiritia level 73 and increasing. Musician's Spiritia level is emanating outward.

00:08:20.960 --> 00:08:26.260
Hey, everybody ! Aim at the light.

00:08:45.310 --> 00:08:46.560
Akiko !
Quickly, this way !

00:08:49.800 --> 00:08:51.100
That should hold them !

00:09:04.260 --> 00:09:05.360
Persistent, aren't you ?!

00:09:09.540 --> 00:09:10.310
Basara !

00:09:22.070 --> 00:09:22.690
Use this !

00:09:27.790 --> 00:09:54.340
Ray !

00:10:07.270 --> 00:10:08.790
Damn, got away...

00:10:08.790 --> 00:10:10.660
Ray...Ray, hang in there !

00:10:10.660 --> 00:10:12.170
Ray, say something !

00:10:12.170 --> 00:10:14.200
There's one person down.
Send an ambulance.

00:10:27.180 --> 00:10:33.250
Well, there were no internal injuries,
so it's probably no big deal.

00:10:33.250 --> 00:10:37.150
We'll need to keep you
here until the wound closes.

00:10:37.150 --> 00:10:38.110
Please, take care.

00:10:39.310 --> 00:10:41.500
We were really worried, Ray.

00:10:43.260 --> 00:10:45.350
15 stitches
in my gut.

00:10:45.350 --> 00:10:47.500
It's a badge of courage.

00:10:49.570 --> 00:10:53.320
Geez, you're not some pro-wrestler
boasting about his injury !

00:10:53.320 --> 00:10:56.980
Dammit ! You're lucky
it was nothing major.

00:10:56.980 --> 00:10:57.810
Right...

00:10:57.810 --> 00:11:01.530
I'm sorry... because you
were trying to protect me...

00:11:01.830 --> 00:11:05.190
Don't worry about it, Akiko...
It was just an accident.

00:11:05.190 --> 00:11:06.310
But...

00:11:06.310 --> 00:11:09.090
Back then, why didn't
you shoot, Ray ?

00:11:10.470 --> 00:11:12.770
When the enemy was
right in front of you...

00:11:14.490 --> 00:11:17.690
That's because I don't
know how to use a gun.

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:19.090
What ?!

00:11:19.660 --> 00:11:21.550
Let's go fill
out his paperwork.

00:11:22.120 --> 00:11:22.910
Okay.

00:11:43.230 --> 00:11:45.620
Ray, where's my Valkyrie ?

00:11:45.620 --> 00:11:47.200
The maintenance is
done already, right ?

00:11:48.200 --> 00:11:49.070
Probably.

00:11:49.070 --> 00:11:51.050
Where is it ?
I'll go get it !

00:12:11.690 --> 00:12:13.120
How many enemy craft ?

00:12:13.120 --> 00:12:16.640
Medium craft 5,
small craft 4; Speed 10.7.

00:12:16.640 --> 00:12:19.410
Enemy craft
approaching area B.

00:12:19.410 --> 00:12:20.990
And what about
Diamond Force ?

00:12:20.990 --> 00:12:22.760
Preflight preparations complete.

00:12:23.460 --> 00:12:26.050
D-Force, launch.
Catapult is clear.

00:12:30.090 --> 00:12:31.930
Ray, I'll go get it.

00:12:34.110 --> 00:12:35.170
Wait a sec.

00:12:35.170 --> 00:12:37.560
Come on...
where did you leave it ?

00:12:37.560 --> 00:12:38.610
Basara...

00:12:38.610 --> 00:12:39.560
What is it ?

00:12:39.560 --> 00:12:43.420
Go and wait in Akusho.
I'll contact you there.

00:12:43.420 --> 00:12:44.320
Contact me ?

00:12:44.320 --> 00:12:45.510
Yeah.

00:12:47.110 --> 00:12:48.060
I'm counting on you.

00:12:56.320 --> 00:12:58.690
It's okay.
You're safe in the hospital.

00:13:03.050 --> 00:13:04.880
Hey, what happened ?

00:13:04.880 --> 00:13:07.460
Basara wouldn't have
taken him, would he ?

00:13:07.460 --> 00:13:08.640
I wonder...

00:13:08.640 --> 00:13:11.090
Ray can't even stand...

00:13:11.930 --> 00:13:13.890
This is Ray Lovelock.

00:13:13.890 --> 00:13:16.940
How's the maintenance
going on the VF-19 ?

00:13:17.550 --> 00:13:21.740
Okay...can I ask you to
bring it to the exit ?

00:13:23.460 --> 00:13:28.710
How about G-3 ?
It's close to a catapult. Right.

00:13:28.710 --> 00:13:29.660
I'll meet you there.

00:13:30.260 --> 00:13:31.590
I'm going to go
look for him.

00:13:31.590 --> 00:13:32.950
Wait, Mylene.

00:13:36.500 --> 00:13:38.640
It's no use...
you'll never find him.

00:13:39.310 --> 00:13:42.060
He probably left
because he wanted to.

00:13:53.050 --> 00:13:53.860
Mylene ?

00:13:53.860 --> 00:13:55.270
Yes ?

00:13:55.270 --> 00:13:59.540
Remember when you asked
Ray why he didn't shoot ?

00:13:59.540 --> 00:14:00.760
Yes...

00:14:01.770 --> 00:14:04.470
He won't shoot.

00:14:05.160 --> 00:14:06.970
He refuses to fight.

00:14:07.410 --> 00:14:11.870
Ray was a pilot back before
Macross 7 was launched.

00:14:11.870 --> 00:14:16.880
Together, Ray, Kinryu, and Stephan
were the Pink Pecker team.

00:14:16.880 --> 00:14:18.740
Pink Pecker...?!

00:14:18.740 --> 00:14:19.760
That's right.

00:14:23.540 --> 00:14:24.620
Uh...

00:14:24.620 --> 00:14:29.200
In particular, Ray and Stephan were really
good friends, and always hung out together.

00:14:29.200 --> 00:14:34.610
Then one day, during a Zentraedi attack, Ray
and Stephan were caught behind enemy lines.

00:14:34.610 --> 00:14:39.210
Not sure whether to attack or retreat,
Ray decided to attack.

00:14:39.210 --> 00:14:43.310
Stephan tried to stop him,
but Ray wouldn't listen to him...

00:14:43.310 --> 00:14:45.310
...and Stephan was killed.

00:14:50.520 --> 00:14:57.450
Taking responsibility for Stephan's death, he
retired from the military and stopped fighting.

00:14:57.450 --> 00:15:00.920
Akiko, is that when you
became friends with Ray ?

00:15:00.920 --> 00:15:01.740
With Ray ?

00:15:01.740 --> 00:15:03.010
Yeah.

00:15:03.010 --> 00:15:05.510
Yes...

00:15:11.120 --> 00:15:13.820
I was Stephan's girlfriend.

00:15:17.010 --> 00:15:20.850
It was Ray who cheered me
up when I was depressed.

00:15:21.980 --> 00:15:23.570
It was rough for Ray, too.

00:15:38.340 --> 00:15:39.190
Dammit...

00:15:41.550 --> 00:15:47.880
Thanks to him, I got better, but the
scars in Ray's heart have never faded.

00:15:48.740 --> 00:15:56.610
It had been a while, but when I saw him,
he was happy, having found a new dream.

00:15:56.610 --> 00:15:58.520
A new dream ?

00:16:00.700 --> 00:16:02.960
It was Basara.

00:16:02.960 --> 00:16:05.050
What ? Basara ?

00:16:05.050 --> 00:16:06.310
That's right.

00:16:06.310 --> 00:16:09.740
He seemed young again.
I was jealous.

00:16:09.740 --> 00:16:11.690
Jealous ?

00:16:11.690 --> 00:16:17.010
Right. It was as if he had to live
right for Stephan's sake, too.

00:16:19.540 --> 00:16:21.540
I should've picked
a different spot.

00:16:22.300 --> 00:16:25.630
A dream he wants to
commit his life to.

00:16:25.990 --> 00:16:28.410
Basara...?

00:16:28.410 --> 00:16:31.250
You don't understand
men either, do you ?

00:16:31.250 --> 00:16:33.860
One thing's for sure...
it's silly.

00:16:42.930 --> 00:16:44.030
Woodpecker ?

00:16:44.030 --> 00:16:45.510
It's "pink."

00:16:45.510 --> 00:16:47.300
You're 52 seconds late.

00:16:47.300 --> 00:16:50.390
My watch doesn't
have a second hand.

00:16:50.390 --> 00:16:51.510
You can take care
of the rest, right ?

00:16:51.510 --> 00:16:54.010
Yeah, thanks.
You saved me.

00:17:01.710 --> 00:17:02.980
Basara ?

00:17:06.440 --> 00:17:07.230
Damn !

00:17:07.230 --> 00:17:08.390
D-1 to D-2.

00:17:08.390 --> 00:17:09.850
Yes, Commander ?

00:17:09.850 --> 00:17:12.760
Physica's in trouble.
I'm going back to support him.

00:17:12.760 --> 00:17:13.810
You'll be okay, right ?

00:17:13.810 --> 00:17:14.960
Yes, sir.

00:17:14.960 --> 00:17:16.120
Umm...Commander ?

00:17:16.120 --> 00:17:17.120
What is it ?

00:17:17.120 --> 00:17:19.680
Has that civilian craft that
always shows up appeared yet ?

00:17:19.680 --> 00:17:22.640
You mean the "Karaoke Ninja" ?
He probably quit. Never mind him.

00:17:23.070 --> 00:17:24.060
Understood.

00:17:24.060 --> 00:17:27.260
I'm not looking for him. I'm glad
he's not here to get in my way.

00:17:39.620 --> 00:17:41.570
Why do you always
pull stunts like this ?

00:17:41.570 --> 00:17:43.310
I told you I'd
go and get it !

00:17:44.000 --> 00:17:46.470
My buddies are
kind of shy...

00:17:46.470 --> 00:17:48.250
So, if it wasn't me...

00:17:50.060 --> 00:17:51.760
What ? Wait...

00:17:52.360 --> 00:17:54.170
I'll carry you
back to the van.

00:17:54.170 --> 00:17:55.380
Don't be ridiculous.

00:17:55.380 --> 00:17:58.110
I can drag myself to
the van just fine.

00:17:58.110 --> 00:18:02.120
Instead, you better get going.
We're using the military's hatch secretly.

00:18:02.120 --> 00:18:04.390
So you'd better hurry up.

00:18:05.300 --> 00:18:07.060
You're always pulling
stunts like this...

00:18:07.060 --> 00:18:08.980
You better head straight
back to the hospital !

00:18:08.980 --> 00:18:09.840
Okay.

00:18:11.320 --> 00:18:13.620
If you don't go back,
I'll never forgive you !

00:18:16.260 --> 00:18:18.660
What are you waiting for ?
Hurry up and go !

00:18:18.660 --> 00:18:20.060
I'm fine over here !

00:18:20.710 --> 00:18:23.660
The rain feels good.

00:18:23.660 --> 00:18:26.370
Just let me stay out
here a bit longer.

00:18:35.190 --> 00:18:36.150
Bastard...

00:18:38.160 --> 00:18:39.550
He's a pesky one...

00:18:46.940 --> 00:18:47.840
That's...!

00:18:47.840 --> 00:18:48.690
It's him !

00:19:01.310 --> 00:19:09.080
Let's go and run into the morning glow,
that we once dreamed of.

00:19:09.080 --> 00:19:12.560
It's still far away though...

00:19:12.560 --> 00:19:13.340
Maybe, it'll be alright if
we keep our love all the time.

00:19:13.340 --> 00:19:14.340
You're in my way !
Maybe, it'll be alright if
we keep our love all the time.

00:19:14.340 --> 00:19:19.590
Maybe, it'll be alright if
we keep our love all the time.

00:19:19.590 --> 00:19:23.400
If you listen to my song...

00:19:23.400 --> 00:19:26.270
...it's so easy to...

00:19:26.270 --> 00:19:28.670
...cross a heart with another.

00:19:28.670 --> 00:19:30.430
Charging Heart of Love, huh ?
...cross a heart with another.

00:19:30.430 --> 00:19:31.250
...cross a heart with another.

00:19:31.250 --> 00:19:37.630
My heart of love soars into the night sky,
carrying my burning emotions.

00:19:37.630 --> 00:19:42.540
Keep shooting down sadness and anger.

00:19:42.540 --> 00:19:43.100
A heart of love is inside
you too. Face your destiny.

00:19:43.100 --> 00:19:45.100
He's mine ! Don't do anything stupid !
A heart of love is inside
you too. Face your destiny.

00:19:45.100 --> 00:19:50.260
A heart of love is inside
you too. Face your destiny.

00:19:50.260 --> 00:19:56.160
It can go billions of light years ahead.
My charging heart of love.

00:20:06.210 --> 00:20:10.030
Let's dance. The stars are also
singing. That can last even longer...

00:20:10.030 --> 00:20:11.700
You're fighting me !
Let's dance. The stars are also
singing. That can last even longer...

00:20:11.700 --> 00:20:14.100
Let's dance. The stars are also
singing. That can last even longer...

00:20:14.100 --> 00:20:17.450
...when I wave my wings. Rock with me.

00:20:17.450 --> 00:20:24.450
Baby, I'll do it somehow, so don't let go.

00:20:24.450 --> 00:20:28.160
Listen to my song, and...

00:20:28.160 --> 00:20:31.090
...regain your power.

00:20:31.090 --> 00:20:36.120
You shouldn't give up until the end.

00:20:36.120 --> 00:20:42.450
My heart of love soars into tomorrow,
leaving a glowing red trail.

00:20:42.450 --> 00:20:47.610
Scatter the excitement and smile.

00:20:50.580 --> 00:20:53.910
For some reason, I was able to
sing better than usual today.

00:21:05.010 --> 00:21:07.310
Ray ! Ray ! Ray !

00:21:13.730 --> 00:21:15.090
Will he be okay ?

00:21:15.090 --> 00:21:16.960
He'll be okay.

00:21:16.960 --> 00:21:18.810
You have a lot of confidence
in him, don't you ?

00:21:24.100 --> 00:21:27.640
Ray really got chewed
out by the doctor.

00:21:27.640 --> 00:21:29.140
Of course.

00:21:29.140 --> 00:21:32.330
He had to perform the same
surgery on him twice in one day.

00:21:32.330 --> 00:21:34.880
I think he'll behave
for a while now.

00:21:34.880 --> 00:21:38.110
So, Akiko, let's go to
a restaurant. Come on.

00:21:38.110 --> 00:21:40.260
You're not taking me ?

00:21:40.260 --> 00:21:43.980
I'm going to be talking about
grown up stuff with Miss Akiko.

00:21:43.980 --> 00:21:47.670
Why don't you go to your room and
chomp on a burger like a good little boy ?

00:21:48.570 --> 00:21:50.740
I'll go do that.

00:21:52.970 --> 00:21:54.290
Just listen to me.

00:21:54.290 --> 00:21:57.930
The Valkyrie that was here
this morning...is it still here ?

00:21:57.930 --> 00:22:01.770
I'm sorry, sir, but I am not
permitted to answer that question.

00:22:06.390 --> 00:22:08.110
Congratulations on
your recovery.

00:22:10.510 --> 00:22:12.820
It's definitely better here.

00:22:12.820 --> 00:22:16.160
Without you, it's like
there's a big void here.

00:22:16.810 --> 00:22:18.490
One more piece of good news:

00:22:19.480 --> 00:22:22.400
Fire Bomber's promo video.

00:22:22.400 --> 00:22:23.370
Really ?!

00:22:23.370 --> 00:22:28.210
Yup. It's still a rough cut, but your
last stage show seemed to be a hit.

00:22:28.210 --> 00:22:29.880
We did it, huh, Ray ?

00:22:34.320 --> 00:22:36.860
It seems like another part
of your dream's been realized.

00:22:40.670 --> 00:22:41.880
Dream, huh ?

00:22:42.790 --> 00:22:44.140
It's okay.

00:23:07.210 --> 00:23:13.390
Our voices synchronize just like falling in love and kissing.

00:23:16.220 --> 00:23:23.530
My heart is always here for you.

00:23:25.630 --> 00:23:30.700
But, oh! I wonder what your shining eyes...

00:23:31.810 --> 00:23:39.680
...are searching for ? Oh, My Friends !

00:23:40.870 --> 00:23:51.360
I'm going to run with you toward a star where our dreams are.

00:23:53.260 --> 00:24:03.070
When we look at each other everything will become real.

00:24:11.450 --> 00:24:13.070
Preview

00:24:13.070 --> 00:24:14.350
Yahoo ! I've been selected
to play a role in a TV drama !
Preview

00:24:14.350 --> 00:24:16.730
Yahoo ! I've been selected
to play a role in a TV drama !

00:24:16.730 --> 00:24:20.400
In show biz, there are guys out there that are
more dangerous than vampires ! Be careful !

00:24:20.400 --> 00:24:21.610
What's that
supposed to mean ?

00:24:21.610 --> 00:24:23.170
Next time, "Minmei Video."

00:24:23.170 --> 00:24:23.490
Stop being so much
trouble for me!

00:24:23.490 --> 00:24:25.450
Minmei Video
Stop being so much
trouble for me!

00:24:25.450 --> 00:24:26.430
Minmei Video
